# Face images and biometric data must never be committed.
# Anchored on purpose: a bare "storage/" also matched the source folder src/Infra/Storage/,
# because git on Windows ignores case, and silently kept the image-store code out of the repo.
/storage/
/src/Api/storage/
models/*.onnx
# Ad-hoc test photos dropped next to the scripts.
/scripts/*.png
/scripts/*.jpg
/scripts/*.jpeg
appsettings.Local.json
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Real face photographs must never be committed. The synthetic placeholders in
# docs/samples are tracked deliberately; anything added under a personal/ subfolder is not.
docs/samples/personal/
